{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"清澈的柔情仍在，底下却涌出更直接、近乎身体性的渴望。\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"from\": [\"S06\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M18\", \"M25\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他已发现柔情能安慰自己，却仍牵着他想靠近对方；沉进去后，愿望便有了身体热度。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S06\"],\n      \"explains\": [],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M18\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"这股热度让他舍不得抽身；快感里混着遗憾，他明知被卷进去却暂时不想停。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S01\", \"S05\", \"S06\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M20\", \"M25\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他能停留在私密柔情里，却不能凭自己的感受知道对方是否也靠近；快感因此未能抹去遗憾。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S01\", \"S05\", \"S06\"],\n      \"explains\": [],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M20\", \"M25\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"沉醉仍是甜的，他却开始感觉这一刻正流过去，美好不能因此停住。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S05\", \"S06\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M26\", \"M28\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他已不必急着推进下一步，能真正享受柔情；因此开始舍不得眼前的时刻过去。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S05\", \"S06\"],\n      \"explains\": [],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M26\", \"M28\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"new\": [\n    \"他发现，私密柔情会把想靠近对方的愿望推成身体性的渴望，并使他暂时不愿抽身。\",\n    \"他开始感觉，正因为这份柔情此刻真能安慰自己，时刻流逝也变得难以忽略。\"\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B1\",\n      \"why\": \"B1把热度推到“对生的眷恋”，但前文只支持对对方的身体性渴望，无法判断这是否是独立的生命感，不把它写成确定的心理事实。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "dd3559c7-6cfe-4d35-a756-a59c1869c2b2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T234422006146Z", "elapsed_seconds": 109.375, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T23:46:11.384470+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "29662d4cd9154c5a487d9a301bdfad9255038a62a8278107a7d014c2e272851a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T234422006146Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "67b7208ee1c1e762792ca6b307b904e26aa69e2a2f643e670fa3dba7bc851a43"}}}
